+/**
+ * Subscriber turn quota lease adapter.
+ *
+ * A lease is opened once at turn start, usage deltas are recorded as they
+ * arrive, and the lease is finalized at turn/end or cancellation.  There is
+ * intentionally no one-token fallback: without an authoritative lease the
+ * subscriber request is refused.
+ */
